      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738747666482,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Study context api (imp) -> system ui.\nAbort controller.\nApi naming convenstion.\nAdd polls to the chat ui.\nAdd stickers to the ui (this will be amazing).\nMessage yourself.\nGoogle RCS messages, emoji reactions.\nTelegram emoji single emoji animation.\nSearch in chat ui -> important.\nSend location to the user.\nPlay the video in the ui.\nSticker Maker in the ui.\nEmoji reactions.\ndetails section like, link, images, pdfs(pdfs seperate ui div),\nIMAGES, like whatsapp does it's grid, \nupdate and edit messages as well important.\nSkeleton for all the loading states.\nForward Messages -> IMPORTANT.\nwallaper change. upload your own.\nview once feature IMPORTANT -> cron bhi use ho jayngi esmai\nThemes in the ui -> will be tough, but will be a really good feature.\nScheduled Messages\nRead recipts\nTyping indicator\nMessage timestamps -> this is half implemented\nManage group activity -> Important, group creating is done already.\nAdmin roles -> add members, deleted members.\nSend messages like photos(done),videos(pending),pdf(pending), voice note(pending).\nImage preview modal.\nSelf destructing images,\nDisappreading chat.\nScheduled messages.\nEdit message, but only before a certain time.\nPin chats, like whatsapp.\nHandle JWT expire.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Study context api (imp) -> system ui.\nAbort controller.\nApi naming convenstion.\nAdd polls to the chat ui.\nAdd stickers to the ui (this will be amazing).\nMessage yourself.\nGoogle RCS messages, emoji reactions.\nTelegram emoji single emoji animation.\nSearch in chat ui -> important.\nSend location to the user.\nPlay the video in the ui.\nSticker Maker in the ui.\nEmoji reactions.\ndetails section like, link, images, pdfs(pdfs seperate ui div),\nIMAGES, like whatsapp does it's grid, \nupdate and edit messages as well important.\nSkeleton for all the loading states.\nForward Messages -> IMPORTANT.\nwallaper change. upload your own.\nview once feature IMPORTANT -> cron bhi use ho jayngi esmai\nThemes in the ui -> will be tough, but will be a really good feature.\nScheduled Messages\nRead recipts\nTyping indicator\nMessage timestamps -> this is half implemented\nManage group activity -> Important, group creating is done already.\nAdmin roles -> add members, deleted members.\nSend messages like photos(done),videos(pending),pdf(pending), voice note(pending).\nImage preview modal.\nSelf destructing images,\nDisappreading chat.\nScheduled messages.\nEdit message, but only before a certain time.\nPin chats, like whatsapp.\nHandle JWT expire.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 868
    },
